"As you try to scale a massive rock blocking your path, a cruel twist of fate" 
"sends you tumbling backward. Gravity's ruthless grip pulls you down, sending"
"a sharp wave of pain racing through your back like a fiery dagger."   
"****"
"The world spins and your breath catches in agony as a point of life is stripped" 
"from your fading energy. This clumsy fall leaves a painful mark on your body, a" 
"harsh reminder of the dangers lurking along your journey. (-1 HP)"   
""
